# Pyrewood Gearhulk: "When this creature enters, other creatures you control get +2/+2 and gain vigilance and menace until end
# of turn." (CR 611.2c) Bot1 has a Memnite from turn 1, Bot2 one from turn 2. When Bot1 casts the Gearhulk on turn 3 its Memnite is
# a 3/3 with vigilance and menace, Bot2's stays a 1/1, and the Gearhulk itself is only the 7/7 with its own two keywords
# (other creatures, not this one). A Memnite entering afterwards would not be reached (the creatures are fixed as the
# ability resolves), and the effects end with the turn.

